<title>CHINA: China Jan-May crude, natural gas output up.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May crude, natural gas output up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 67.3815 million tonnes of crude oil in the first five months of the year, up 3.5 percent compared with the same year-ago period, a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>China produced 13.892 million tonnes of crude oil in May alone, the bureau said.</p>
<p>China's natural gas output reached 9.933 billion cubic metres from January to May, up 7.7 percent compared with the same year-ago period, it said.</p>
<p>Natural gas output in May alone was 1.928 billion cubic metres, it said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
